      {
        "key": "adaptive-HoAI26-layout-and-spacing-26-b8561ce0-5788-4c6f-bb4d-15242c2f59cd",
        "text": "### Crowded?\nWhen everything competes for attention, it’s hard to know where to look.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/ce2860098c51fd223e70317d971825ff-exec-fe26a9ce-3913-46f6-a827-825eaf85fe44.png",
        "layout": "text-top-left"
      },
      {
        "key": "adaptive-HoAI26-layout-and-spacing-26-c5d19123-347f-4907-9eea-f01b4a70c5cb",
        "text": "### Give each part room.\nAsk AI to add **spacing** so each section is easier to scan.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/d4d89e11cad248d1f6b64c9ecc49af24-exec-bb553cd5-1d63-46cf-b593-25c9355f15bc.png",
        "layout": "text-top-left"
      },
      {
        "key": "adaptive-HoAI26-layout-and-spacing-26-cd11d90c-e2d0-4105-ab67-d3a54d1b88a4",
        "text": "### Guide the eye.\nPut the main idea first. Use **order** to lead visitors toward the next step.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/9802e2dccac9604194848285962c0cc2-exec-e9e426a5-7613-47f3-b7e2-ee6c9b094648.png",
        "layout": "text-top-left"
      },
      {
        "key": "adaptive-HoAI26-layout-and-spacing-26-6b38049a-14c4-4738-a592-7119c11ccfea",
        "text": "Order guides the eye.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/06d52b077194cea6cf18de551ed109c8-exec-cd0ffc20-ba9e-4074-be21-5125bdf75ea3.png",
        "layout": "text-top-left"
      }
    ],
    "generate_outline": "Understand the importance of space, alignment, and order in web design. Learn how proper spacing gives elements room, alignment creates tidiness, and clear order guides the user's eye on a page.",
